    "name": "Countertop beverage machine outer assembly (espresso-style)",
    "description": "Multi-solid CAD assembly representing an appliance enclosure with a front removable faceplate, rear vent/control cover, internal cavity/drip-area, a central brew-head interface with actuating lever/rod, and a right-side steam-wand interface. Geometry dominated by large blended shells plus repeated small cylindrical/planar faces for vents, pads, and fastener/feature details.",
